OL,3,GNEWSAResidents respond to
OL,4,Arollercoaster's rejection
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome residents living in the shadow of
OL,7,Fa prototype rollercoaster that
OL,8,Foverlooks their properties have said
OL,9,Fthey are pleased it may have to be
OL,10,Ftaken down - but others say they will
OL,11,Fmiss it.
OL,13,FThe test ride had been erected at a
OL,14,Fformer aerodrome near Sandford Lane, in
OL,15,FHucknall, Nottinghamshire, prompting
OL,16,Fcomplaints from residents about noise,
OL,17,Fvisual impact and a loss of privacy.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
